    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LTG202 · Assessment 4/4</span>\n<h2>Final project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13752 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LTG202 · Đầu điểm 4/4</span>\n<h2>Final project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13752 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">Final exam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">50.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">25'/group</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1-&gt;8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Project</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Written components + Presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">The project will assess the knowledge and application of course learning outcomes from the delivered chapters. Questions will be based on the key topics covered in each chapter.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">*by exam board, using computer.<br>* Written Deliverables: Students must submit all written components of the project to the Examination Office by the end of Week 10. The Examination Office will then forward the submissions to the teacher responsible for marking the presentation;<br>*Presentation: Students will present their project findings in a 20 -minute presentation and 5-minute Q&amp;A during the final examination period.<br>*Students will work in groups of 4 members. In cases where the total number of students does not allow for equal grouping, teams of three or five members may be formed to accommodate the class size.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">If a student's project does not meet the required standards, the teacher should provide constructive feedback to guide improvement. This will enable the student to revise both the written component and the presentation, and resubmit their work prior to delivering the updated presentation during the resit examination period.<br>- Components:<br>1. Written components: 50%<br>2. Presentation: 50%</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 60 — Final Project Review</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 60 — Final Project Review</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
